[h1]Version 2.0.0[/h1]

[quote]Physics accuracy pass: every environmental model upgraded to its authoritative published form, a full test programme behind it, and deeper compat with ACE3, KAT, and ACM.[/quote]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Unit test programme: 183 tests across seven suites mirroring the physics models (reference, edge-case, and monotonicity checks), run by a single command and gated by the pre-commit hook
[*]Dedicated-server integration test: ten-phase headless verification in Docker (settings, function resolution, state surface, determinism, module coverage, biome resolution, edge cases, performance budget)
[*]Host-compat integration tests: ACE3, ACRE2, TFAR, KAT, and ACM verified against the real mods in a live server
[*]Coarse WMM magnetic-declination lookup for the compass
[/list]

[b]Changed[/b]
[list]
[*]Physics models upgraded to authoritative forms: SAE J1349 engine derating, slip-curve traction, Nash-cascade rivers, NRMM route degradation, FAA time-of-useful-consciousness hypoxia, ISO 17166 UV with ozone, Friis radio path loss, ITU-R P.531 ionospheric absorption, Arrhenius Q10 CBRN persistence, Rothermel fire spread, Stefan freeze/thaw, harmonic tides (M2/S2/K1/O1), WMO Beaufort sea state, ICAO eddy-dissipation-rate turbulence, NWS microburst tiers, Cn² atmospheric seeing, Atlas rain extinction, and more
[*]Precipitation phase now follows the wet-bulb temperature — snow forms well above 0 °C in dry air
[*]Post-process effects unified under a central arbiter: single owners for chromatic aberration, dynamic blur, and colour corrections, with hysteresis and generation-guarded disables (flicker eliminated)
[*]Particle effects ported from the drop command to #particlesource with lifecycle management and a source-count budget
[*]Wind now updates in real-weather mode instead of freezing
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]UV index ozone coefficient was 40× too strong — UV collapsed to zero at every realistic ozone level
[*]Friis path loss divided the log argument by ln(10) instead of the result — the radio propagation index was dead at its floor
[*]Coriolis deflection fed radians to a degrees-expecting sine — ~50× too small
[*]Tidal spring/neap used the wrong trig function with a spurious radian conversion — the beat stretched to 846 days
[*]Frost on windscreens read a never-written variable — frost formed on overcast nights
[*]Pressure trend now reports the true 3-hour WMO window instead of the 5-second tick delta
[*]weather.json values range-checked at the trust boundary
[*]Compat fixes: ACRE2 signal callback scale, TFAR multiplier names, KAT body-fluid array corruption, ACM dead code and contamination scaling, ACE3 weather-tick ownership
[*]Dedicated-server runtime errors: gust undefined headless, malformed-position crashes, garbage-parameter crashes
[/list]

[b]Removed[/b]
[list]
[*]Dead ace_medical_dehydrationRisk write that polluted the ACE3 namespace
[/list]

[b]Documentation[/b]
[list]
[*]Wiki expanded to the current physics surface: configuration chapter (all 30 settings), module and state-variable reference synced to the code, integration chapter per host mod, and annexes covering the upgraded formulas
[/list]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Version 1.0.0[/h1]

[quote]First stable release.[/quote]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]CBA utilisation: standalone keybinds, AEE_WeatherUpdated local event, player-killed handling
[*]Solar-radiation diurnal model following the sun's elevation
[*]Soil moisture and evaporation water cycle
[*]Deterministic event state via a seeded LCG
[*]Thunder follows the flash
[*]AI-player, map-rotation, and module-coverage test phases
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]WBGT (Stull 2011) used SQF atan in degrees; the formula needs radians
[*]getSunPosition returns nil on a dedicated server — guarded
[*]getDirVisual can return NaN for freshly spawned AI — guarded
[/list]

