[h1]Version 0.1.0[/h1]

[quote]Modular restructure and canonical wiring.[/quote]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Modular restructure into 18 addons with canonical ACE3/CBA function wiring
[*]Standalone core with no ACE3 dependency; compat addons gate on their host mod
[*]Deterministic multiplayer state
[*]EDEN module (AEE Environment Config)
[*]Headless dedicated-server test harness
[*]CI: HEMTT lint, SQF validation, SBOM on release, release-drafter
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Function compilation: no function was compiled before this release — the mod did not run
[*]ACE3 bridge removed the fake ace_weather_current* variable interface
[*]Dedicated-server runtime errors found by the headless test
[*]Missing logo assets removed from mod.cpp
[/list]